@guide H_35_DustwallowMarsh
@name Dustwallow Marsh (43-44)
@faction Horde
@levels 43-44
@zone Dustwallow Marsh
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Dustwallow Marsh, visit 2 of 3 on the Horde route, levels 43-44.
@next H_36_Desolace

travel Dustwallow Marsh
fp Brackenwall Village
accept 1169 Identifying the Brood | Draz'Zilb.
accept 1166 Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern
accept 1168 Army of the Black Dragon | Tharg.
complete 1169 Identifying the Brood | Black dragonspawn in the south.
complete 1168 Army of the Black Dragon
complete 1166 Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern | Mok'Morokk's Snuff: loot Mok'Morokk's Snuff. Mok'Morokk's Grog: loot Mok'Morokk's Grog.
turnin 1169 Identifying the Brood
accept 1170 The Brood of Onyxia
turnin 1166 Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern
turnin 1170 The Brood of Onyxia
accept 1171 The Brood of Onyxia
turnin 1171 The Brood of Onyxia
accept 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip]
note  [hc=only] | Hardcore: the eggs lie in the Wyrmbog, close to the dragonkin guarding Onyxia's Lair. Stay on the outer edge, and leave this quest out rather than go deep.
complete 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip] | Destroy the eggs in Wyrmbog.
turnin 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip]
turnin 1168 Army of the Black Dragon
level 44 | Desolace starts at 44. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
